  "details": "The new camera is wonderful, and the focus/blur options are great. However it becomes difficult to use when the Object you are trying to Blur is the background behind the player. Especially for times when you are recording a video/etc where you are moving around. This causes the local player to be blurred and unblurred as they go in and out of the focus point.\nHaving an extra option for auto focusing on the localplayer or blurring only the background would be a very nice addition.\nThank you for your time!",
